abstract = {The theme of the workshop was "Methodological Issues with Empirical Studies in Software Engineering". We aimed at gaining a better understanding about the adoption of the empirical paradigm in software engineering (SE). Specifically, we focused on identifying issues, discussing those issues, and finding solutions for the issues in currently employed empirical methods.},
