abstract = {Welcome to the 1st Workshop on Principles of Agentic Engineering (PAgE 2026), held on June 15, 2026, in Boulder, Colorado, United States, and co-located with PLDI 2026. PAgE brings together researchers and practitioners from programming languages, formal methods, software engineering, and artificial intelligence to develop principled foundations for safe and reliable AI agents. The workshop focuses on techniques for specifying, testing, verifying, monitoring, debugging, and repairing agentic systems that plan, call tools, maintain state, and act over real-world services and data.},
